{
  "slug": "arn-code",
  "name": "Arn Code",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Structured, artifact-driven development pipeline for Claude Code — plan, implement, review, and ship features with three ceremony tiers. 25 pipeline skills, 14 specialist agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **37 skills** and **18 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (37): `arn-assessing` (This skill should be used when the user says \"assessing\", \"arness assessing\", \"assess\", \"assess codebase\", \"technical review\", \"codebase…), `arn-code-assess` (This skill should be used when the user says \"arness code assess\", \"arn-code-assess\", \"assess codebase\", \"technical review\", \"codebase…), `arn-code-batch-cve-fix` (This skill should be used when the user says \"fix CVEs\", \"patch vulnerabilities\", \"apply security patches\", \"resolve security…), `arn-code-batch-cve-scan` (This skill should be used when the user says \"scan for CVEs\", \"CVE scan\", \"check for vulnerabilities\", \"find…), `arn-code-batch-implement` (This skill should be used when the user says \"batch implement\", \"implement all\", \"batch execution\", \"implement all features\",…), `arn-code-batch-merge` (This skill should be used when the user says \"batch merge\", \"merge batch\", \"arness batch merge\", \"arn-code-batch-merge\", \"merge…), `arn-code-batch-planning` (This skill should be used when the user says \"batch planning\", \"batch plan\", \"arness batch planning\", \"arn-code-batch-planning\", \"plan…), `arn-code-batch-simplify` (This skill should be used when the user says \"batch simplify\", \"cross-feature simplify\", \"batch simplification\", \"simplify all features\",…), and 29 more\n- **Agents** (18): `arn-code-architect` (This agent should be used when the user needs to design how a specific feature should be implemented…), `arn-code-batch-analyzer` (This agent should be used when the arn-code-batch-planning skill needs to pre-generate draft feature specifications for multiple features…), `arn-code-batch-pr-analyzer` (This agent should be used when the arn-code-batch-merge skill needs to analyze multiple open batch PRs for cross-cutting…), `arn-code-bug-fixer` (This agent should be used when a bug has been diagnosed and a fix plan exists (either inline…), `arn-code-codebase-analyzer` (This agent should be used when the user asks to \"analyze codebase\", \"find codebase patterns\", \"explore project structure\",…), `arn-code-cve-analyst` (This agent should be used when the arn-code-batch-cve-scan skill needs per-CVE triage during the discovery + triage phase…), `arn-code-doctor` (This agent should be used when the arn-code-report skill needs to diagnose Arness workflow issues in the current…), `arn-code-drift-detector` (This agent should be used when invoked by the arn-code-plan or arn-code-pick-issue skills to verify that a previously-written…), and 10 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install arn-code@claude-community` from `AppsVortex/arness` (`plugins/arn-code`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 37,
    "agent": 18
  },
